Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})上！混沌幻魔阿特拉坦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把电子终结龙夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)电子终结龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙的目标是通过让混沌幻魔阿特拉坦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备上电子终结龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从而在这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇之剑中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻止新电子终结龙的召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)本该是万能的七皇之剑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)居然被抓住了那微小的破绽。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)啊～啊… 龙使者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然被夺走了龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么说也太丢人了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)太丢脸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})你的王牌已经被封住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你打算怎么战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，看来我太小看你们的力量了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是快斗的师父，也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我也是巴利安七皇之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去可不会结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤防霸龙 赫利俄斯菲亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的怪兽竟然特意以攻击表示！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有赫利俄斯菲亚的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在塔奇翁回到自己手牌之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想拖延时间吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马：{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… V》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡 No.升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己墓地的一只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其效果无效化特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次降临于我的天空吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 照亮胜利之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.9 天盖星 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我发动魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法-重返！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法卡1张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将墓地里的银冠混沌之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回手牌 再次发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级9的戴森球{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！CNo.9！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}覆盖天空的星辰啊将森罗万象 寄宿于其中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻 降临于此吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天盖妖星 混沌戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米迦勒 这只怪兽可以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗过的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成自己的超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这张卡一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对手造成500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 把超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个个增加……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后随着回合累积
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不断给对手造成大量伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 真是个狠角色怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实 是只强力的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但只要我的场上还有赫利俄斯菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗 就无法成立。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 混沌·戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元只有一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区500点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算花上好几个回合来打倒我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，就在这个回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:05:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我们的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有一只混沌怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)我发动混沌亚特兰蒂斯的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃战斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用三个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的生命值变为1！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为1！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不是效果伤害，而是把生命值……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为1吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，那些家伙的目标就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，混沌大神的效果一旦确定！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·大神的球体效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切也都是多玛斯拼上性命{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留下的决斗数据才得以实现的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这是我们兄弟三人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)消散吧 米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高傲的异晶人七皇战士啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)能量填充 95%。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全系统 无异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}距离发射准备完成还有314.25秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)嗯？ 快 快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)V和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.13,0:07:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在决斗的地点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感知到能量扩散了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管了，继续作业。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵 遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！这样一来七皇之一就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会 为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的LP 还剩下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在等？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不受到效果伤害的话就无法发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 伤害反弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 通过对方卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将发生的伤害无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有这种陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！ 然后这个效果发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家 将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧表示存在的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择1张必须回到卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 选择的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是怪兽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要受到那个攻击力数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我们场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧表示的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是混沌阿特兰塔尔和混沌大日球体。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩余生命值2800的我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论把哪张回到卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值都会变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们要回避伤害的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你们的选择只有一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)装备状态的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不作为怪兽卡对待{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 你们不会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若是你们的话 必定能越过赫利俄斯之壁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以效果伤害给我致命一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被干掉了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}舍肉断骨的战法…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将装备着的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙选择{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放回你的卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备被解除的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:10:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们混沌超量怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}混沌・大・球体的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}发动{\fnYusei Magic}！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你造成800点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗嗦！ 永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动伤害·交替！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在效果伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个效果伤害无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我会将和那个伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有相同攻击力的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.23,0:10:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤 星间龙 帕塞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)救救我 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈 别怪我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是和游马打起来我会很困扰的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是为了千尊大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升级魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}The Seventh One！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧，No.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙，叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧，CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿翻涌的银河{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从时间诞生之前，苏醒吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越永恒之龙之星！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Neo银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Neo银河眼时空龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})拥有如此气场的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们凋零的时刻似乎到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到最后的最后我也不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 怪物链发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自身场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有混沌巨神球体存在时发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}封锁对手怪兽的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步 永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰蒂斯邀请发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有混沌亚特兰蒂斯存在时发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手怪兽在回合间没有攻击的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽将被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步 将攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说被封锁了攻击的那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随着这个回合的结束被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我会受到攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}败北… 就是这么回事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我可不会让你得逞。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张新·塔奇昂还在！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动新·塔奇昂的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个混沌超量·单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡以外的卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到回合结束全部无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.66,0:13:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并恢复到本回合开始时的状态！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时间暴君！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)由此 场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都将无法使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯有新·银河眼·塔奇昂·龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不受这个效果的影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像时间倒流了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 既然如此 再次发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在发动了时间暴君的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有得到我允许的场上的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽才是绝对的时间支配者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动 新银河眼时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上没有攻击过的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让新时空龙的攻击变成3次！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}系统无异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}距离脱离大气层{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有58.03秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《V… {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，看来时间争取得很充分。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}争取时间？ 难道你们这些家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。是凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在前往月球。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月球？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)然后游马和星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在前往异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马… 后面就拜托你了》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((兄长大人的仇 我一定要亲手报！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不像你这样的胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 跟你说话真是让人心烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不甘心的话就证明你自己的做法给我看！))
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们该做的事是结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！V！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)决斗已经
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔的 CNo.？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！V！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们已经平安踏上旅途了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来只需将七皇的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刻入那双眼中。然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来我要说的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你们好好听。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)快斗前往了月球。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月球？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器](V)那是为了达成某个目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特在解开龙的传说过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:16:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}推导出了一个说法。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是集齐 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}密码就无法生效吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次造访了那座金龙的遗迹进行了调查。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发现了一块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}画着龙的石碑。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“光与时间之龙 于诞生之地相逢之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河之瞳… 真正睁开
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开启新世界之门”。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那上面 就是这么写的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光与时间之龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 光子与快子的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 诞生之地是？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道你打算去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)两只银河眼的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其胜者将开启新世界之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那正是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码能够运作{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的意思没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我想知道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为真正的龙使
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙所拥有的真实…))
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙的传说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以你们是为了让游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 让快斗踏上旅程{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才用决斗来拖住我们吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…！ 那为{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}报仇这件事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 我马上就来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 别做傻事！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]这就是 我们敌人的巴利安七皇的实力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好刻在眼里 继续前进！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟… 决斗饭 多谢款待。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]还有 替我跟游马的奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和姐姐也问个好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}告诉她们 饭很好吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说你没出息说你烦人 对不起…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]那不是真心话。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]游马，你是真正的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能遇见你，真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你……然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}告别的话说完了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击混沌阿特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极时空螺旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:19:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，攻击混沌大音球！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……后面就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们……永远与你……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与你那炽热的灵魂同在。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对两人 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马大人 生命反应……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。 高傲的兄弟啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)要去吗？ 去那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最大的敌人正在等着。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 抬起头来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的思念都托付在你身上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:21:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啊…… 我知道……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
